## Commercial / Enterprise Use — Paid

Any use in a commercial, enterprise, or revenue-generating context requires
a paid license. This includes but is not limited to:

- Use within a company or organization (regardless of size)
- Use by freelancers or consultants for client work
- Integration into a product or service that is sold or monetized
- Use on machines owned by a business entity

To obtain a commercial license, contact: smkzw@users.noreply.github.com

